, \"I am not over you a manager [i.e., authority].\"","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"6:67","t":"For every news [i.e., happening] is a finality; and you are going to know.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"6:68","t":"And when you see those who engage in [offensive] discourse concerning Our verses, then turn away from them until they enter into another conversation. And if Satan should cause you to forget, then do not remain after the reminder with the wrongdoing people.","j":7,"h":14,"s":6,"a":68,"sd":null}],"juz":7,"hizb":14,"surahs":[6],"sajdah":false}